  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "9 large potatoes, peeled",
    "1 (8 ounce) container sour cream",
    "1 (6 ounce) package cream cheese",
    "1 teaspoon onion salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 dash ground black pepper",
    "0.5 cup shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "1 pinch dried parsley flakes, or to taste",
    "1 pinch paprika, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Butter a 9x13-inch casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/okeOqpnq3KIi79crHrkDqIBXAE4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-261265-easy-mashed-potato-casserole-VAT-step-01-c2199a2151c146dfb246859cd30c88c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261265/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes into a large pot and cover with salted water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes. Drain potatoes; reserve water for mashing, if necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_mzejjD0eHbC_Gk8lSgKnj9VWVc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-261265-easy-mashed-potato-casserole-VAT-step-02-1262e70d504544b7b7db30191e4239f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261265/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sour cream, cream cheese, onion salt, garlic powder, and pepper to the potatoes. Using a potato masher or electric beater, beat the potato mixture until creamy. Add reserved cooking liquid, 1 tablespoon at a time, only if needed to achieve a creamy consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e_Ea1fsxTEToh7LXmtrPpg3024A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-261265-easy-mashed-potato-casserole-VAT-step-03-1mashing-91aad77146a34a609791d3f36fe22340.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261265/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mashed potatoes into the prepared casserole dish; sprinkle Cheddar cheese, parsley, and paprika on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LpvpaVrQPiGJxzFjYsl_-aR6Llo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-261265-easy-mashed-potato-casserole-VAT-step-04-23786c881ffd46e3bcb7cbbbce760aec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261265/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake, uncovered, until cheese is melted and bubbly, about 35 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CACeS1DpMmj9P1DkpgOEXYf-ADk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-261265-easy-mashed-potato-casserole-VAT-step-05-e1e5c6efd78144888694531317f68d1c.jpg"
